        "claim": "Check a graph from its structure through save and reload, navigation, and semantic zoom, not just that it parses.",
        "rationale": "A graph can be valid JSON and still fail: a missing edge-class ref or handle, a landing frame that hides content, or a View that does not survive a save and reload.",
        "evidence": "The composition contract's checklist asks for verification of the interface widget, the landing-surface frame, sparse View resolution, navigation, and save and reload. The idea template lists parsing every touched file and verifying surfaces, bridge refs, class bindings, edge endpoints, handles, and edge-class refs.",
