      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "Build to settled rules and leave provisional behavior unspecified",
        "perspective": "Some behavior is still being designed, and the safest graph does not depend on it.",
        "distinction": "View fitting, camera rollover, and edge lanes are listed as open gaps. A graph that encodes a guess about them will need rewriting when they are ratified.",
        "implications": "Author content and relationships that survive any reasonable resolution, size frames deliberately, and avoid persisting invented fitting or lane schemas.",
        "documentation": "An interpretation of the model inventory's remaining-gaps and rewrite-rule sections.",
